  "description": "Event shapes derived from an Etymon Schema, committed as a snapshot and compared for compatibility in both directions: can new code read events already written, and can already-deployed code read events written by new code. Pure and driver-free. It never emits SQL, never opens a connection, and never proposes rewriting an event, because the events already written are the one irreplaceable thing in the system.",
